/Title (The idea, as illustrated in Figure 7-4, is that we chain the prompt template together with the LLM to get the output we are looking for. Instead of having to copy-paste the prompt template each time we use the LLM, we would only need to define the user and system prompts.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 504 0 R
/Prev 569 0 R
>>
endobj
