<<
/Title (One of the most intuitive forms of giving LLMs memory is simply reminding them exactly what has happened in the past. As illustrated in Figure 7-10, we can achieve this by copying the full conversation history and pasting that into our prompt.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 613 0 R
>>
endobj
