624 0 obj
<<
/Title (To make these models stateful, we can add specific types of memory to the chain that we created earlier. In this section, we will go through two common methods for helping LLMs to remember conservations:)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 626 0 R
/Next 622 0 R
>>
endobj
625 0 obj
<<
/Title (A Chain with Multiple Prompts)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
